{"slug":"find-a-times-in-list","title":"LISP练习——找到\"a\"在列表中出现的次数","date":"2020-06-12","tags":["Lisp"],"category":"Expand Learning","excerpt":"在LISP中用循环以及递归两种方式实现：找到a在列表中出现的次数","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>在LISP中用循环以及递归两种方式实现：找到a在列表中出现的次数</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"循环方式\">循环方式</h3>\n<h3 id=\"loop-lisp\">loop-lisp</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(defun a-times-loop (lst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (do (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (e (car lst))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (times 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ((null e) times)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (if (eql 'a e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (setf times (+ times 1)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (setf lst (cdr lst))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (setf e (car lst))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(let ((lst '(a b c d)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (format t \"A in list ~A is: ~A ~%\" lst (a-times-loop lst))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 期待输出：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; A in list (A B C D) is: 1</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">lisp</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"递归方式\">递归方式</h3>\n<h3 id=\"recursive-lisp\">recursive-lisp</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(defun a-times-recursive (lst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (if (null lst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (+ (if (eql 'a (car lst)) 1 0) (a-times-recursive (cdr lst)))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(let ((lst '(a b c d)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (format t \"A in list ~A is: ~A ~%\" lst (a-times-recursive lst))) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 期待输出：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; A in list (A B C D) is: 1</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">lisp</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>","related":[{"slug":"special-data-type-practice","title":"LISP 学习——特殊数据类型的操作练习","date":"2019-11-16","tags":["Lisp"],"category":"Expand Learning","excerpt":"LISP数据类型学习","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"lisp-basic-practice","title":"LISP基础练习","date":"2019-10-01","tags":["Lisp"],"category":"Expand Learning","excerpt":"LISP基础练习","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"define-a-function","title":"LISP练习——定义一个函数，接受一个列表并返回一个列表，指出相等元素出现的次数，并由最常见至最少见的排序","date":"2019-09-09","tags":["Lisp"],"category":"Expand Learning","excerpt":"LISP函数练习","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1}]}